<!DOCTYPE html>
<html class="light" lang="en">
  <head>
    <%- include('../partials/head') %>
  </head>
  <body class="min-h-screen bg-surface-bright text-on-surface hf-dashboard">
    <% const messageUser = typeof currentUser === 'object' && currentUser ? currentUser : {}; %>
    <% const displayName = messageUser.fullName || 'Renter'; %>
    <%- include('../partials/sidebar-renter') %>

    <header class="sticky top-0 z-40 flex min-h-16 items-center justify-between border-b border-outline-variant bg-surface px-4 shadow-sm md:pl-[264px] md:pr-8">
      <div class="min-w-0"><p class="truncate text-label-sm font-bold text-secondary">Renter workspace</p><p class="truncate text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant"><%= displayName %></p></div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-1 sm:gap-2">
        <a class="inline-flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-on-surface-variant hover:bg-surface-container-low" href="/user/renter/notification-bell" aria-label="Notifications" title="Notifications"><span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">notifications</span></a>
        <a class="inline-flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-on-surface-variant hover:bg-surface-container-low" href="/user/renter/messages" aria-label="Messages" title="Messages" aria-current="page"><span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">chat_bubble</span></a>
        <a class="inline-flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-on-surface-variant hover:bg-surface-container-low" href="/user/renter/settings" aria-label="Settings" title="Settings"><span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">settings</span></a>
        <a class="inline-flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-on-surface-variant hover:bg-surface-container-low" href="/user/renter/profile" aria-label="Renter profile" title="Renter profile"><span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">person</span></a>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main class="w-full px-4 py-6 md:ml-[240px] md:w-[calc(100%-240px)] md:px-8 md:py-8 hf-dashboard-main">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl">
        <div class="mb-8 flex flex-col gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:items-end sm:justify-between">
          <div><p class="mb-1 text-label-md font-bold text-secondary">Communication workspace</p><h1 class="text-headline-lg font-bold text-primary">Messages</h1><p class="mt-2 max-w-3xl text-body-md text-on-surface-variant">Review messaging availability and the controls required for safe renter-to-landlord communication.</p></div>
          <a class="inline-flex min-h-12 shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap rounded-lg border border-primary px-6 font-bold text-primary hover:bg-surface-container-lowest" href="/user/renter/support"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-xl" aria-hidden="true">support_agent</span>Message support</a>
        </div>

        <section class="mb-8 border-y border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-low px-5 py-6 sm:px-6" aria-labelledby="renter-messaging-status-title">
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4"><span class="material-symbols-outlined flex h-12 w-12 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary text-on-primary" aria-hidden="true">forum</span><div><p class="text-label-sm font-bold uppercase text-secondary">Service unavailable</p><h2 id="renter-messaging-status-title" class="mt-1 text-headline-md font-bold text-primary">Messaging is not connected</h2><p class="mt-2 max-w-3xl text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">No conversation, participant, message, delivery, or read-status records exist. Do not send identity documents, banking details, passwords, access codes, or other sensitive information through Contact while messaging is unavailable.</p></div></div>
            <span class="inline-flex min-h-11 shrink-0 items-center rounded-full bg-surface-container-high px-4 text-label-sm font-bold text-on-surface-variant">0 conversations</span>
          </div>
        </section>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 xl:grid-cols-12">
          <div class="space-y-8 xl:col-span-8">
            <section aria-labelledby="renter-conversation-list-title">
              <div class="mb-4"><h2 id="renter-conversation-list-title" class="text-headline-md font-bold text-on-surface">Conversations</h2><p class="mt-1 text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Search, unread filters, threads, composing, attachments, and read receipts require persisted authorized conversations.</p></div>
              <div class="rounded-lg border border-dashed border-outline-variant px-5 py-12 text-center"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-4xl text-outline" aria-hidden="true">chat_bubble_outline</span><h3 class="mt-3 font-bold text-on-surface">No conversations</h3><p class="mx-auto mt-2 max-w-xl text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">No landlord, property manager, letting agent, or support thread is created by the current application.</p><a class="mt-5 inline-flex min-h-12 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-lg border border-primary px-5 font-bold text-primary hover:bg-surface-container-low" href="/user/renter/applications"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-xl" aria-hidden="true">assignment</span>Open applications</a></div>
            </section>

            <section aria-labelledby="renter-messaging-controls-title">
              <div class="mb-4"><h2 id="renter-messaging-controls-title" class="text-headline-md font-bold text-on-surface">Required messaging controls</h2><p class="mt-1 text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Communication must be bound to real accounts and housing records, not client-only sample content.</p></div>
              <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
                <article class="rounded-lg border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest p-5"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary" aria-hidden="true">group</span><h3 class="mt-3 font-bold text-on-surface">Authorized participants</h3><p class="mt-2 text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Every thread must identify participants, roles, related listing or application, access scope, and membership history.</p></article>
                <article class="rounded-lg border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest p-5"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary" aria-hidden="true">send</span><h3 class="mt-3 font-bold text-on-surface">Durable delivery</h3><p class="mt-2 text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Messages need server timestamps, idempotency, ordering, delivery states, retries, duplicate prevention, and explicit failure recovery.</p></article>
                <article class="rounded-lg border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest p-5"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary" aria-hidden="true">report</span><h3 class="mt-3 font-bold text-on-surface">Safety and reporting</h3><p class="mt-2 text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Blocking, reporting, moderation escalation, rate limits, abuse evidence, and urgent-safety guidance need clear feedback.</p></article>
                <article class="rounded-lg border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest p-5"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary" aria-hidden="true">policy</span><h3 class="mt-3 font-bold text-on-surface">Retention and attachments</h3><p class="mt-2 text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Retention, deletion, export, attachment scanning, authorization, access revocation, and audit history need defined ownership.</p></article>
              </div>
            </section>

            <section aria-labelledby="renter-message-lifecycle-title">
              <div class="mb-4"><h2 id="renter-message-lifecycle-title" class="text-headline-md font-bold text-on-surface">Required message lifecycle</h2><p class="mt-1 text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">No status is available until one messaging service owns the complete history.</p></div>
              <dl class="divide-y divide-outline-variant rounded-lg border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest text-body-sm"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2 p-5 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between"><dt class="font-bold text-on-surface">Thread creation and participant authorization</dt><dd class="shrink-0 whitespace-nowrap text-on-surface-variant">Unavailable</dd></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-2 p-5 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between"><dt class="font-bold text-on-surface">Message acceptance and durable storage</dt><dd class="shrink-0 whitespace-nowrap text-on-surface-variant">Unavailable</dd></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-2 p-5 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between"><dt class="font-bold text-on-surface">Delivery, read state, and notification</dt><dd class="shrink-0 whitespace-nowrap text-on-surface-variant">Unavailable</dd></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-2 p-5 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between"><dt class="font-bold text-on-surface">Failure, block, report, export, and deletion</dt><dd class="shrink-0 whitespace-nowrap text-on-surface-variant">Unavailable</dd></div></dl>
            </section>
          </div>

          <aside class="space-y-6 xl:col-span-4" aria-label="Messaging guidance">
            <section class="rounded-lg border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest p-6" aria-labelledby="renter-communication-safety-title"><h2 id="renter-communication-safety-title" class="text-headline-md font-bold text-primary">Communication safety</h2><ul class="mt-4 space-y-3 text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant"><li class="flex gap-3"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-xl text-primary" aria-hidden="true">check</span><span>Keep application and tenancy discussions within authorized participants.</span></li><li class="flex gap-3"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-xl text-primary" aria-hidden="true">check</span><span>Never share passwords, login codes, raw bank or card details, or property access codes.</span></li><li class="flex gap-3"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-xl text-primary" aria-hidden="true">check</span><span>Use an approved document service for sensitive identity, income, or tenancy evidence.</span></li><li class="flex gap-3"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-xl text-primary" aria-hidden="true">check</span><span>Keep message persistence, read state, and notification delivery as separate records.</span></li></ul></section>

            <section class="rounded-lg border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest p-6" aria-labelledby="renter-messaging-actions-title"><h2 id="renter-messaging-actions-title" class="text-headline-md font-bold text-primary">Messaging actions</h2><dl class="mt-4 divide-y divide-outline-variant text-body-sm"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 py-3"><dt class="text-on-surface-variant">New conversation</dt><dd class="shrink-0 whitespace-nowrap font-bold text-on-surface">Unavailable</dd></div><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 py-3"><dt class="text-on-surface-variant">Send or edit</dt><dd class="shrink-0 whitespace-nowrap font-bold text-on-surface">Unavailable</dd></div><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 py-3"><dt class="text-on-surface-variant">Attachments</dt><dd class="shrink-0 whitespace-nowrap font-bold text-on-surface">Unavailable</dd></div><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 py-3"><dt class="text-on-surface-variant">Search and unread</dt><dd class="shrink-0 whitespace-nowrap font-bold text-on-surface">Unavailable</dd></div><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 py-3"><dt class="text-on-surface-variant">Block or report</dt><dd class="shrink-0 whitespace-nowrap font-bold text-on-surface">Unavailable</dd></div></dl><nav class="mt-5 grid grid-cols-1 gap-2" aria-label="Messaging help links"><a class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center justify-between rounded-lg px-3 font-bold text-on-surface hover:bg-surface-container-low" href="/user/renter/applications"><span>Applications</span><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-xl" aria-hidden="true">arrow_forward</span></a><a class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center justify-between rounded-lg px-3 font-bold text-on-surface hover:bg-surface-container-low" href="/user/renter/support"><span>Message support</span><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-xl" aria-hidden="true">arrow_forward</span></a></nav></section>

            <section class="border-l-4 border-primary bg-surface-container-low px-5 py-4" aria-labelledby="no-message-inference-title"><h2 id="no-message-inference-title" class="font-bold text-on-surface">No unread or delivery inference</h2><p class="mt-2 text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Missing records do not mean sent, delivered, read, ignored, or urgent. Notification badges must be derived from durable authorized messages, never sample content.</p></section>
          </aside>
        </div>
      </div>
    </main>
    <script src="/js/main.js"></script>
  </body>
</html>
